%% Diagram 12: Sequence Diagram - Sensor Fault Injection
%% Project: Thenar - Smart-Safe Handle Telemetry
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Tester as Tester / Operator
    participant LiveUI as LiveSession (/live)
    participant Store as useThenarStore
    participant Mock as Mock Engine
    participant Solenoid as Solenoid Deadbolt

    Tester->>LiveUI: Toggles 'Inject Sensor Fault' (injectFault = true)
    LiveUI-->>Tester: Fault armed badge (ARMED)
    Tester->>LiveUI: Clicks 'Start Capture'
    LiveUI->>Mock: generateAttemptFrames('owner', 'S4', prng, injectFault=true)
    Mock-->>LiveUI: returns frames with corrupted force channel midway

    Note over LiveUI,Store: Real-time 100 Hz Streaming Phase
    loop During kinematic stream (dt = 10ms)
        LiveUI->>LiveUI: Updates animated scrolling LiveChart
        opt Mid-gesture (elapsed > 45% of trajectory)
            Note over LiveUI: HX711 Load Cell signal drops to NaN / disconnected
            LiveUI->>LiveUI: setSensorHealth({ hx711: false })
            LiveUI-->>Tester: HX711 status dot turns RED
        end
    end

    Note over LiveUI,Store: Fail-Secure Emergency Abort Protocol
    LiveUI->>Store: set({ lockState: 'FAULT' })
    LiveUI->>Store: addNotification('sensor_fault', 'live.decision_fault')
    Store->>Solenoid: Bolt remains SECURED (Fail-Secure deadbolt never retracts)
    LiveUI-->>Tester: Emergency FAULT banner displayed

    Note over LiveUI,Store: Auto-Recovery Timer
    LiveUI->>LiveUI: Waits 3000ms safety timeout
    LiveUI->>Store: set({ lockState: 'LOCKED' })
    LiveUI-->>Tester: System returns to secure standby (LOCKED)
